sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Practitioner as Food Security Analyst / Agronomist
    participant UI as Streamlit / FastAPI Interface
    participant Runner as Inference & Forecast Engine
    participant Registry as Model & Data Registry
    participant Spatial as Geospatial & Spatial Lag Engine

    Practitioner->>UI: Selects County (e.g., Turkana) & Lead Time (t+1, t+2, t+3)
    UI->>Runner: Request calibrated risk probability & confidence interval
    Runner->>Registry: Load feature snapshot & calibrated ensemble weights
    Registry->>Spatial: Fetch Queen-adjacency neighbor risk signals
    Spatial-->>Runner: Return spatially weighted neighbor crisis indicators
    Runner->>Runner: Compute prediction, Platt-calibrated probability, & bootstrap bounds
    Runner-->>UI: Output risk score, 95% CI, and domain attribution weights
    UI->>UI: Render interactive choropleth, timeline trend, & reliability gauge
    UI-->>Practitioner: Display contextual decision-support alert with explicit non-operational disclaimer
